:horiz_container
	Evidence of consolidation* :yes_no {condition_action=show,condition_test=Y,condition_target=cxr_multi_lobar}
	Multi-lobar* $cxr_multi_lobar :yes_no
Collapse $cxr_collapse :yes_no

:horiz_container
	Pleural effusion* $cxr_pleural_effusion :yes_no {condition_action=show,condition_test=Y,condition_target=cxr_pleural_effusion_type}
	Pleural effusion type* $cxr_pleural_effusion_type :dropdown [1=Bilateral,2=Unilateral]

Hyperinflation* :yes_no $cxr_hyperinflation
Cardiomegaly* :yes_no $cxr_cardiomegaly
Septal lines* :yes_no $cxr_septal_lines
Upper lobar diversion* $cxr_upper_lobal_diversion :yes_no
Mass* :yes_no $cxr_mass
		 